                <pb facs="0964" n="874" xml:id="pg874"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">815.51/397: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Honduras</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Belden</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Tegucigalpa</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1920-06-03T15:00:00-05:48"><hi rendition="#italic">June 3, 1920—3
                                p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received 9:55 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>47. Department’s telegram number 32 May 29 [<hi rendition="#italic">28</hi>], 3
                    p.m. Doctor Young will be acceptable under the same conditions as previously
                    stated.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Belden</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
